WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.688
Typed timestamps are more useful for analysis than
display strings They

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:11.943
sort chronologically support arithmetic and retain
temporal semantics A

00:00:11.957 --> 00:00:18.122
formatted string is useful for a person but less
flexible for computation That

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:23.030
is why formatting generally belongs near the output
boundary rather than early in the preparation

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:23.622
pipeline
